WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.415
Most unhappy customers don't complain. They just leave.

00:00:04.465 --> 00:00:06.825
A customer gives you a 3 out of 10.

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:12.607
In most companies, that answer sits in a survey tool, then a spreadsheet, then a monthly report.

00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:15.637
By the time anyone reads it, the renewal is gone.

00:00:16.387 --> 00:00:23.208
Meet NPS Survey CX OS, the customer experience operating system for Salesforce.

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:26.754
It runs entirely inside your Salesforce org.

00:00:26.804 --> 00:00:31.441
A Salesforce event sends the survey, and the answer lands on the right record.

00:00:31.491 --> 00:00:36.719
A low score opens a P1 case, so the account owner can call back the same day.

00:00:37.469 --> 00:00:41.689
Passives get a 30-day nurture. Promoters get a review request.

00:00:42.439 --> 00:00:46.428
Service, sales, success and operations, on one platform,

00:00:46.478 --> 00:00:49.715
with CX360 dashboards for every leader.

00:00:50.465 --> 00:00:56.598
70+ ready-made forms. Branded email, QR codes and your Experience Cloud site.

00:00:56.648 --> 00:00:59.121
And your data never leaves Salesforce.

00:00:59.871 --> 00:01:04.726
One price per company, from $3,500 a year. Not per user.

00:01:05.476 --> 00:01:09.263
Start your 7-day free trial on Salesforce AppExchange.

00:01:09.313 --> 00:01:12.784
NPS Survey CX OS, by SalesHub.
